        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-1481] At any stage of the V2G communication session, the SECC shall stop the V2G communication according to the requirements defined 7.4 when V2G_SECC_Sequence_Timer is equal or larger than V2G_SECC_Sequence_Timeout according to Table 215.",
            "block_bbox": [
                136,
                167,
                1121,
                272
            ],
            "block_id": 1,
            "block_order": 1,
            "group_id": 1,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    136.0,
                    167.0
                ],
                [
                    1121.0,
                    167.0
                ],
                [
                    1121.0,
                    272.0
                ],
                [
                    136.0,
                    272.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-538] The SECC shall respond with the corresponding response message containing a \"ResponseCode = FAILED_SequenceError\" within V2G_SECC_Msg_Performance_Time according to Table 215, if request message was received that the SECC does not expect in the wait state.",
            "block_bbox": [
                137,
                294,
                1120,
                400
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 2,
            "group_id": 2,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    137.0,
                    294.0
                ],
                [
                    1120.0,
                    294.0
                ],
                [
                    1120.0,
                    400.0
                ],
                [
                    137.0,
                    400.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-1482] After sending a message containing a \"ResponseCode = FAILED_SequenceError\", the SECC shall behave according to the requirements defined in 7.4.",
            "block_bbox": [
                138,
                421,
                1119,
                475
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 3,
            "group_id": 3,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    138.0,
                    421.0
                ],
                [
                    1119.0,
                    421.0
                ],
                [
                    1119.0,
                    475.0
                ],
                [
                    138.0,
                    475.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-2222] After the SECC sent a ResponseCode starting with ‘FAILED’ or ‘FAILED_’ it shall terminate the communication by applying [V2G20-034].",
            "block_bbox": [
                138,
                496,
                1107,
                551
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 4,
