        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-4061] If SECC is using ServiceName = DC_ACDP in Table 204, the SECC shall allow receiving a ACDP_DisconnectReq after sending ACDP_ConnectDeviceRes, CableCheckRes, DC_ChargeLoopRes or PowerDeliveryRes.",
